							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							WOW!!!!&nbsp; I can honestly say, I wasn&#039;t sure how many responses I would get on this one.&nbsp; &nbsp;It is soo refreshing to see the impacts on our EQ lives.<br /><br />HUGS all!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
