	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9413"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=148" title="View the profile of Lhyra">Lhyra</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 56<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=148"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg9413#msg9413"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg9413#msg9413">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #21 on:</b> July 21, 2004, 01:07:41 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I like this thread  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm20.gif" alt="cwm20" border="0" /><br /><br />The person I have to regonize first is Jaegerr, known to most as Grynne.  Grynne was created the same day as Ruthann, after he talked me into playing something the reviews called evercrack.  He held my hand as my heart pounded out of my chest on &quot;orc hill&quot;.  The excitement never ended.  When it became obvious I was not the power gamer he was, I latched on to a patient 15 year old boy named Bladestep.  I spent years adventuring with this rogue, while watching him mature into an adult.  I still talk to him monthly even though neither of us play any longer.<br /><br />I met Linette and Polien in the great Divide at level 39.  They were some of the kindest people I had met in the game and encouraged me to join them in a casual guild called Aurora Knights when I dinged 40.  I spent the rest of my evenings with a WONDERFUL group of people, who I still call my family.<br /><br />While it all started for me in Norrath...the fun continues beyond!<br /><br />Ruthann Freespirt - Cleric of Rodcet<br />Maerion Fitzwalter - Rogue of Rodcet<br />Lhyra Skylore - Bard of Rodcet<br />Ghrace Trueheart of Stromm and Maerion Othereye - the druid/rogue duel box team of Stromm<br />(All in hibernation, but still active as I just can&#039;t give them up)<br />Currently:<br />Lhyra - City of Heroes Defender<br />Lhyra - Sorceress of Diablo 2<br />Cuddles Gigglewoof - Toontown<br />Morica - Undead Priest of Khadgar in WoW
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: July 13, 2005, 04:26:03 pm by Lhyra</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
