							I dunno!<br /><br />Kaiyne told me he thought he quit.&nbsp; I met him on an EQ Hiatus in 2000, so maybe he&#039;s taking one again.<br /><br />Ferriciean - If you can get a hold of him..I would REALLY appreciate it.&nbsp; Email me at <a href="mailto:Lyra@powerlynk.com">Lyra@powerlynk.com</a> to let me know that he still lives and breathes.<br /><br />Kaiyne -that CUTE paladin in aqua blue fine plate that looked so sweet with Lhrya in her lambent strolling in LoIO.&nbsp; *wink* (o:P
