	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10346"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=792" title="View the profile of Colleen">Colleen</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 142<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=792"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10346#msg10346"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/thumbup.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10346#msg10346">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #24 on:</b> August 22, 2004, 12:05:57 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I would say there are several people at have impacted my play in EQ.&nbsp; In one way or another they have taught me to be a better player and are just down right nice.&nbsp; These people make EQ enjoyable and fun and a pleasure to know:<br /><br />1. Mightym<br />2. Ehland aka Bonkjoo<br />3. Drozan<br />4. Kaddari<br />5. Beguera aka Threedone<br />6. Woah<br />7. Wordor<br />8. Qadain<br />9. Syndie<br />10. Veto<br />11.&nbsp; And all of Apotheosis<br />12. Maturin aka Tumble<br /><br />There are many more in EQ, there are countless others, if I wrote down all the names we all would be reading forever.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br />Thanks you guys for making EQ FUN !!!!&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Your friendly neighborhood Ranger<br />Colleen Quickness<br />Apotheosis
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
