							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Grynne quit EQ and a friend of his now owns the account. <br /><br />Ferri still plays and still see him almost daily <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
