	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10362"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=794" title="View the profile of Crimsonshade">Crimsonshade</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 12<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/spawn.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								You know you like it Daark!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=794"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.darkempirecentral.org/" title="Dark Empire" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10362#msg10362"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg10362#msg10362">Re: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> August 23, 2004, 08:10:01 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							A wizard (and coworker in RL) named Balsak got me into the game and showed me how to be a truely evil SK&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm21.gif" alt="cwm21" border="0" /><br /><br />When I was a very young SK this wonderful Wizard named Azriphale gave me some bronze armor and a DARK REAVER!!!! This was right after Kunark came out so that was still an ubah weapon. <br /><br />Later on Wayauste, Darkdoc, and Kyrsk helped me emensly with quests, trade skills, and camps. <br /><br />I think I owe the most to my guild leader Needaa though, her leadership has proven invaluable in the past couple of years. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1022266" target="_blank">Crimsonshade Daark</a><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1022461" target="_blank">Shadoween Daark</a><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1022469" target="_blank">Forrestfyre Lyght</a>  <br /><br />Officer and Servant of the Dark Empire
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
