							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Thonar for getting me into the game, then arguing with me online everyday afterwards. <br />The Fizzle fiends 2 yrs ago for helping me get on my feet.<br />Gailard, for helping me get my corpse in CB so many times. <br />Alasse for helpin a poor newbish soul like mine. <br /><br />More recently<br />---------------------<br />Ziga, big impact, bad impact<br /><br />Die Zig~
